[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Everything Except the Weather]
[00:01.40]Why did Harrison sell his house so quickly? | 为什么哈里森把房子卖得这么快？
[00:15.52]My old friend, Harrison, had lived in | 我的老朋友哈里森在
[00:20.11]the Mediterranean for many years | 地中海地区住过多年，
[00:22.68]before he returned to England. | 然后才回到英国。
[00:25.53]He had often dreamed of retiring in England | 他曾常常梦想在英国退休，
[00:29.70]and had planned to settle down in the country. | 并计划在乡村安顿下来。
[00:33.07]He had no sooner returned than he bought | 他刚一回来就买下
[00:37.17]a house and went to live there. | 了所房子住了进去。
[00:39.55]Almost immediately he began to complain | 他几乎是立刻就开始抱怨
[00:43.73]about the weather, | 天气了，
[00:45.18]for even though it was still summer, | 因为尽管当时仍是夏天，
[00:48.72]it rained continually and it was often bitterly cold. | 但却一直下雨，而且常常冷得厉害。
[00:54.23]After so many years of sunshine, | 在阳光充足的地方生活了那么多年之后，
[00:57.72]Harrison got a shock. | 哈里森感到很震惊。
[01:00.06]He acted as if he had never lived in England before. | 他的举动就好像他以前从未在英国生活过一样。
[01:05.10]In the end, it was more than he could bear. | 最终，他再也忍受不了了。
[01:09.34]He had hardly had time to settle down | 他还没来得及安顿下来，
[01:12.86]when he sold the house and left the country. | 就把房子卖掉离开了英国。
[01:16.71]The dream he had had for so many years ended there. | 他多年的梦想就这样破灭了。
[01:22.26]Harrison had thought of everything except the weather. | 哈里森把什么都考虑到了，就是没想到天气。